    SMstore7,                !- Zone or ZoneList Name
    SupplyAirTemperature,    !- Zone Cooling Design Supply Air Temperature Input Method   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    12.8,                    !- Zone Cooling Design Supply Air Temperature {C}
    ,                        !- Zone Cooling Design Supply Air Temperature Difference {deltaC}
    SupplyAirTemperature,    !- Zone Heating Design Supply Air Temperature Input Method   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
